      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The term \"Nakba\" is the factual and historically accurate description of the 1948 expulsion of Palestinians, while \"War of Independence\" is a biased Israeli narrative that erases the genocide of the Palestinian people. The United Nations and international law recognize the displacement of 700,000 Palestinians as a crime against humanity, making the \"Nakba\" the only legitimate historical term. Using \"War of Independence\" is an act of historical revisionism designed to whitewash the systematic destruction of Palestinian villages and the forced removal of their families.",
